  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 2004.06 Renewal of Auto Wholesale Dealer Registration",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2004.06 Renewal of Auto Wholesale Dealer Registration. All auto wholesale dealer registrations shall expire biennially on March 31st and shall be renewed in accordance with the requirements of Saf-C 2003.11(b).\n\nSource. #8966, eff 8-23-07 (formerly Saf-C 2004.03); ss by #11028, eff 1-29-16 (from Saf-C 2004.05)",
